  "features": [
    "Fresh direct TCP connection creation/open and TLS handshake callbacks publish measured connect-start/end and secure-connection-start timestamps.",
    "Pooled requests leave new connection/handshake fields unset; proxy/unix paths are not mislabeled as origin connection measurements.",
    "HTTP-thread snapshots feed the shared resource timeline; ordinary fresh/pooled TCP and trusted local TLS controls pass with ordered phases."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "DNS boundaries, proxy/unix phases, protocol/ALPN exposure, HTTP/2/3, full redirect/cross-origin exposure, failed/data/file requests and partial-consumption accounting remain open under #873/#869.",
    "Initial controls supplied a leaf certificate instead of its CA and queried an unnormalized URL. Both control mistakes are retained; final verification uses the issuing CA with certificate verification enabled and the normalized URL.",
    "The unchanged seven-file scope retains #874: 60 passes plus three process checks and one registered failure/failed file, no skips/TODOs. It is not green.",
    "Previously excluded constructor/Deno regression files remain unverified and were not rerun; full Bun suite, #872 and Release/ASAN/all-platform coverage remain open under #66."
  ],
